    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27015" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lōtŏphăgi</span></b> ,
			ōrum
		<i>Gr. gen.</i> Lotophagōn, <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 4,
				4, § 20</span></i>, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λωτοφάγοι</span> (lotus-eaters), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an African people on
				the Lesser Syrtis, to whom fable ascribes great
